 <h3><u>Aise Waiso se pyaar mat keejo</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Aise waiso se pyaar mat keejo..(2)<br> Ye khata baar baar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Chhod deta hai saath mushkil me..(2)<br> Shaikh par inhesaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Hai nuseri bhi dushmane haider..(2)<br> Dosto me shumaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Jaan atki hai teri duniya me..(2)<br> Jaan par jaanesaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Gar hai ya laytani ka dawedaar..(2)<br> Waqt e nusrat faraar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Jab pukare tujhe imaam e zamaa..(2)<br> Sar ko gardan pa baar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Ho jo maqrooz aale at’har ke..(2)<br> Unse bilkul udhaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Ae muqassil ali ka behre madad..(2)<br> Qabr me intezaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Jisse naaraaz ho ali o batool..(2)<br> Wo rawish ikhteyaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Tang seene pa hai jo matam ke..(2)<br> Fisq se daaghdaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Mai hu mohtaaj ghair ka tere..(2)<br> Aisa parwardigaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Jo saza ho lahad me de lijo..(2)<br> Hashr me sharmsaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Wo jo bhaage ohod se ab unka..(2)<br> Ae habeeb aitbaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Juz ali baab e fath e khaibar me..(2)<br> Ghair ka intezaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Abre aayat kisi munafiq se..(2)<br> Sahibe zulfiqaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Majlise mehfile hai aine ishq..(2)<br> Ishq ko kaarobaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Sibte jafar hai tere darr ka gada..(2)<br> Dar bardar isko khaar mat keejo..(2)<br> <br> Ye Mehfil hai ehle tawalla ki mehfil, yaha sirf hogi mohabbat ki baatein<br> Nafee ghair ki hai mohabbat ka hissa, na samjhe ise koi nafrat ki baatein<br> <br> Siwae nabi aur aale nabi ke, kiya kisne kab hai shifa’at ka waada<br> jise haqne baksha hai haqqe shifa’at, wohi to karega shifa’at ki baatein<br> <br> Yahi to madare wujudo adam hai, yahi malike salsabeelo iram hai<br> Jise hai nabi o ali se mohabbat, use zeb deti hai jannat ki baatein<br> <br> Ba kaaba wiladat, ba masjid shahadat, nabi se mawakha to Zahra se nisbat<br> ali ke hai ye imteyazi fazael, abas hai kisi se fazeelat ki baatein<br> <br> Badha shehr se kaun sakta hai darr ko, mohammad madina ali baab uska<br> Ilaqa nahi ilm o hiqmat se jinko, wahi kar rahe jihalat ki baatein<br> <br> Padi thi jo saccho ki haq ko zarurat, faqad panjetan kaam aaye the haq ke<br> Tumhara na siddiqo siddiqa koi, to karte ho kyu tum sadaqat ki baatein<br> <br> Hunain o ohod ho ya khandak ya khaibar, tike hi nahi jo kisi maareke me<br> lade hi nahi jo kabhi haq ki khatir, na kar unki farzi shaja’at ki baatein<br> <br> Ghaneemat ki mat maar kar jo ghani bangae the, tahi dast khaibar se pehle<br> na dilwa sake haqqe zehra jo unse, to karte ho tum kyu sakhawat ki baatein<br> <br> Nabi jiske maula, ali uske maula, ye chhota sa ek mas’ala tum na samjhe<br> tumhari samajh me jo maula na aaye, to kyu kar rahe ho wilayat ki baatein<br> <br> Na ajre risalat adaa kar rahe ho, na haqqe mawaddat adaa kar rahe ho<br> amal to tumhara hai ghairo ke jaisa, yuhi kar rahe ho bara’at ki baatein<br> <br> Jamal neherwaan aur siffin o qatle abuzar saqeefa fidak aur khaibar<br> ali ki sharafat ki baatein hai inme, to ghairo ke sharr aur aafat ki baatein<br> <br> Khuda ke nahi waledain o aizza, na aulad o zauja na roti na kapda<br> nusairi ko samjhaiye sibte jafar, wo kyu kar raha hai himaqat ki baatein</p> 
